Hello team,
It looks like there is a bug with packrat that is affecting proper detection of dependencies if you are running on pre 3.2.0 R versions.  We are working on a fix that will fix that, but until then I think your best bet to get unblocked is to move to a newer version of R.
Apologies for the hassle.
-Tareef

